id: jack-of-all-styles-mark
name: Jack of All Styles
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: what Jack of All Styles' (2) gives, held till the end of your turn.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Jack of All Styles: Wound Rolls 2(T) higher until the end of your turn.
text: >
  Jack of All Styles (2): If you use a Unique Ability, increase your Wound Rolls by 2(T) until the end of your turn.

---

[passive]
wound += 2(T);
